      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>지능(Intellect)</keyword>
        <keyword>동기(Motive)</keyword>
        <keyword>감정(Emotion)</keyword>
        <keyword>기질(Temper)</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>지능(Intellect)</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 안전관리론 · 안전 심리의 5요소
정답은 ①이다. 안전 심리의 5요소는 동기, 기질, 감정, 습성, 습관이다. 지능은 5요소에 포함되지 않는다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>지능(Intellect)</choice_text>
          <commentary>지능은 해당하지 않으므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>동기(Motive)</choice_text>
          <commentary>동기는 5요소이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>감정(Emotion)</choice_text>
          <commentary>감정은 5요소이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>기질(Temper)</choice_text>
          <commentary>기질은 5요소이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
